{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12216160","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12216160","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1221616001:0":{"text":"回来了回来了，可算是等到人了。","source_cn":"回来了回来了，可算是等到人了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6ABD39A005380D05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221616002:0":{"text":"有……什么事吗？今天的勤务应该都做好了……啊，要是还有什么事也没问题的！","source_cn":"有……什么事吗？今天的勤务应该都做好了……啊，要是还有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD73B880674D85AD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221616003:0":{"text":"咱们兄弟可是专门来找你的。今天的勤务工作做得真是不错！","source_cn":"咱们兄弟可是专门来找你的。今天的勤务工作做得真是不错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9711F487B5F717CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221616004:0":{"text":"对不起对不起，我们一定改……诶？你说做得不错？","source_cn":"对不起对不起，我们一定改……诶？你说做得不错？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AEFDC80B8A3DDCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221616005:0":{"text":"对啊！咱们和水鬼帮干了一架，刚才回来一看，可给咱们乐坏了！","source_cn":"对啊！咱们和水鬼帮干了一架，刚才回来一看，可给咱们乐坏了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD7A8CE12413CD8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1221616006:0":{"text":"东西摆得整整齐齐，武器擦得闪闪发光。听说你们还去帮忙赶鸭子了，哈哈。","source_cn":"东西摆得整整齐齐，武器擦得闪闪发光。听说你们还去帮忙赶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA02386B3A3E8511","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1221616007:0":{"text":"今天的晚饭得算你们一份功劳！","source_cn":"今天的晚饭得算你们一份功劳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FD280A66638DF9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1221616008:1":{"text":"你是说……你们是来夸我们的？真是没想到……","source_cn":"你是说……你们是来夸我们的？真是没想到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE76709BB4ACE2BC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1221616009:0":{"text":"嗐，我们也没想到啊。你们今天可真是干得漂亮。","source_cn":"嗐，我们也没想到啊。你们今天可真是干得漂亮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE24DE2F1A16535C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1221616010:0":{"text":"哦……要是兄弟们多关心关心我们，我们也满足了……","source_cn":"哦……要是兄弟们多关心关心我们，我们也满足了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00D727910A796F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1221616010":{"text":"哦……要是兄弟们多关心关心我们，我们也满足了……","source_cn":"哦……要是